:arroz rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/gugafm11/ontologies/2026/untitled-ontology-11#massa
:massa rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/gugafm11/ontologies/2026/untitled-ontology-11#massaOriental
:massaOriental rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                        :PratoOntologicamenteAmbíguo ;
               :têmIngrediente :massa ,
                               :soja .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/gugafm11/ontologies/2026/untitled-ontology-11#rissoto_de_ervas
:rissoto_de_ervas rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                           :PratoVegano ;
